Release a cloud of deadly miasma over a targeted area, dealing [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100; MP 100)] darkness damage to all units inside it with a 20% chance of inflicting a disease that will do blight damage and weaken either Constitution, Strength or Dexterity for [4, 5, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage will scale with the highest of your spell or mind power.
